Flash - {{Mani|"Contractor Houryokuin Kanetsugu" & C4 or more|(Your Turn)}}
By sending your  to the Trash, pay one cost from the target to summon this card from the Hand.

{{Burst|s|After an opposing Spirit's (When Summoned/Reborn) effect resolves}}
Summon this card without paying the cost. Then, put two cores from the Void to any Spirits you control. Also, if you have four counters or more, and you control any "Houryokuin Kanetsugu", during this turn, the opponent can't end the Attack Step via effects.

[LV1][LV2]
Once per turn, when your "Ninja Gale" family Spirits would leave the Field due to opposing effects, one of those targets can remain on the Field, exhausted.
